  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fix NativeConcurrentArena. When another thread called ScratchScoped or InitializeScoped while the arena's own thread was scratching, the new range could share memory with that thread's leases; other threads' scoped ranges now stay out of the memory that thread allocates from. Threads can also now run Scratch initializers on the same arena at the same time, where 0.3.0 threw NativeAllocationInUseException, and a failed initializer gives back only space that no other lease uses. Fix NativeTransfer. When Move found a callback running on another thread, the storage could stay held until finalization after that callback ended, and a callback refused during a Move or Dispose could leave the moved transfer, or a builder's next transfer, refusing every callback and disposal. Dispose, Move and NativeShared.Create also no longer fail while a stale copy's callback is leaving.",
